[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]背景：为何爆发[/font][/b]


中平六年（189）[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "董卓", "cat": "people"}]董卓[/url][/color]入京，废少帝立献帝，把持朝政。他的军政人事安排出现严重失策——内应官员周毖、伍琼蒙蔽他，将[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "袁绍", "cat": "people"}]袁绍[/url][/color]外放为勃海太守（大郡，百万人口），又将[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "韩馥", "cat": "people"}]韩馥[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "刘岱", "cat": "people"}]刘岱[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "孔伷", "cat": "people"}]孔伷[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "张邈", "cat": "people"}]张邈[/url][/color]等异己人士安排出任州郡。同年十二月，[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "曹操", "cat": "people"}]曹操[/url][/color]在陈留起兵，标志讨董序幕正式拉开。


